  "description": "Rosaline is a strong and noble imperial knight whose glowing reputation ironically makes her unapproachable. Therefore, she secretly turns to adult novels to satisfy her less noble urges. When Rosaline is captured by an enemy tribe on a mission, a part of her is excited about being stripped down and degraded by her captors like the heroine in her favorite novel. And her merciless punishment arrives in the form of Attila, the fierce tribe chief who seems hellbent on getting revenge...\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)\n\n*Note: Part of Ridi's Jujonggwangye GL Danpyeonseon (주종관계 GL 단편선) Collection.*",
